b/de6163834f53ca92c1273fff98ac9078.jpeg", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6278464, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%B2%BE%E8%87%B4%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E6%94%BE%E7%88%B8%E5%A6%88%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%98%E6%A0%B7", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%B2%BE%E8%87%B4%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E6%94%BE%E7%88%B8%E5%A6%88%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%98%E6%A0%B7"}, {"id": 17, "title": "时隔14年进口片再夺国庆档票房日冠", "desc": "2026国庆档，张译、马丽主演的《神探之痕迹》强势领跑前半程。但从10月5日起，德国、法国、美国合拍片《生化危机：爆发夜》接管“战场”，连续多日拿下单日票房冠军。这也是近14年来，进口电影第一次在国庆档拿下票房日冠。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/51da867cf59e432b054e622e0d48416d", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6176936, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%9414%E5%B9%B4%E8%BF%9B%E5%8F%A3%E7%89%87%E5%86%8D%E5%A4%BA%E5%9B%BD%E5%BA%86%E6%A1%A3%E7%A5%A8%E6%88%BF%E6%97%A5%E5%86%A0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%9414%E5%B9%B4%E8%BF%9B%E5%8F%A3%E7%89%87%E5%86%8D%E5%A4%BA%E5%9B%BD%E5%BA%86%E6%A1%A3%E7%A5%A8%E6%88%BF%E6%97%A5%E5%86%A0"}, {"id": 18, "title": "警惕这个“无声的杀手”", "desc": "8日是全国高血压日。在很多人的观念中，“头晕”“头疼”是高血压的很多表现，但实际上高血压是一个“无声的杀手”，其损害往往在出现明显症状前就已悄然发生。最新数据显示，我国18岁及以上成年人群高血压患病率高达31.6%，超半数患者对病情一无所知。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/024c922be9b382b430a8960d80e6430d", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6086708, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%AD%A6%E6%83%95%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E5%A3%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%80%E6%89%8B%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%AD%A6%E6%83%95%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E2%80%9C%E6%97%A0%E5%A3%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%80%E6%89%8B%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 19, "title": "今日寒露", "desc": "今日寒露已至，大雁南飞，雀影渐稀，秋菊次第绽放。目前北方早菊已开，南方金蕊正盛。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a3613c869c04e5c4846a6b0f028a7133", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5985083, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%AF%92%E9%9C%B2", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%AF%92%E9%9C%B2"}, {"id": 20, "title": "58岁主妇假期在景区当兼职NPC", "desc": "10月8日，宁波山海九龙源景区首批18名兼职NPC将完成任务。此前9月初，该景区招聘兼职NPC引超700人争抢。58岁全职主妇徐娟因兼职NPC走红，称快乐比200元日薪更有意义。目前景区NPC渐成职业化，网红NPC日薪可达万元，专家呼吁其向“文化翻译官”进阶并完善标准。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/5aa646d4533dad0f78dcb1fba5bbb43d", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5892940, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=58%E5%B2%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%A6%87%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%85%BC%E8%81%8CNPC", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=58%E5%B2%81%E4%B8%BB%E5%A6%87%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E5%BD%93%E5%85%BC%E8%81%8CNPC"}, {"id": 21, "title": "吴奇隆 不赚钱也是这个立场", "desc": "继国庆在天安门手持国旗之后，吴奇隆又晒出爬长城、游览天坛的视频。他坚持称 “我们国家”，并回复网友：不赚钱也是这个立场。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/0417d4e90b3b2d41f237f53cb090c24b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5806394, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%B4%E5%A5%87%E9%9A%86%20%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%9A%E9%92%B1%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%B4%E5%A5%87%E9%9A%86+%E4%B8%8D%E8%B5%9A%E9%92%B1%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9C%BA"}, {"id": 22, "title": "11位学生与86岁老师重逢", "desc": "10月6日，湖北谷城县迎来一场跨越53年的师生重逢。陈家山中学11位学生代表手捧鲜花，与86岁恩师代习哲温情相聚，共叙半世纪情谊。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7547f0cd376420898688733853c82c73", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5694993, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=11%E4%BD%8D%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E4%B8%8E86%E5%B2%81%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E9%87%8D%E9%80%A2", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=11%E4%BD%8D%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E4%B8%8E86%E5%B2%81%E8%80%81%E5%B8%88%E9%87%8D%E9%80%A2"}, {"id": 23, "title": "广州粤菜师傅单间炒菜工位走红", "desc": "近日，广州一餐厅为粤菜师傅设置独立玻璃炒菜工位的视频走红。顾客可直观查看猛火炒菜全过程，被网友戏称为粤菜师傅的专属工位。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/16275347f971be995bc54e97dc96b33c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5609181, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E7%B2%A4%E8%8F%9C%E5%B8%88%